"hash_xxh64":"0xA41B69C27BF324DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1510662016:0":{"text":"투타 마을 사람들은 다 죽었으니 널 도와줄 사람은 우리밖에 없어. 의식이 순조롭게 진행되길 바란다면, 광원이 어디 있는지 어서 말해.","source_cn":"现在图塔镇的人都死了，只有我们能帮你。想让仪式顺利举行...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C9CAEA93D2CEE03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1510662017:0":{"text":"모르간, 어떻게 그렇게 직접적으로...","source_cn":"摩根，怎么能如此直接——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54FC6867CD799A27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1510662018:1":{"text":"주... 죽었다니... 모두 다 죽었다니... 역시... 들킨 거야...","source_cn":"死……死了……大家，都死了……果然……被发现了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B9FDE6EF463EBA0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1510662019:0":{"text":"...<style=\"highlight\">열쇠 하나</style>가... 우리 집에 있는데 그 열쇠로... <style=\"highlight\">광원이 숨겨진 문</style>을 열 수 있어...","source_cn":"有……<style=highlight>一把钥匙</s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDC891F844DEF779","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1510662020:0":{"text":"좋아. 계속 말해 봐. 그래서, 그 문은 어디에 있는데?","source_cn"